{"ID":"20240513083156-yde1b16","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083156-yde1b16","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083156-yde1b16\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151726-3yr2ykk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151726-3yr2ykk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151726-3yr2ykk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:306\u0026#125;","title":"184","type":"doc","updated":"20240514140804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513151726-3yr2ykk","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 997px;","id":"20240513151726-3yr2ykk","updated":"20240514140804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"157-4 C, CY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Male"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"39"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癆症覆診"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日一行，7點晨起如廁，排便大致順暢，大便軟。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好，半夜3-5點會起來小便。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還好，久站會腰痠。可能因睡眠不安穩，有時會頭昏、打呵欠，但精神還好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍黃，仍有泡沫，喝水多時顏色較淡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"會，喜喝室溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 皮膚乾癬仍在，但顏色較淡，癬皮較薄，有時會癢想去搔抓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 左腳腎石點無壓痛感但壓時仍有感覺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平時溫暖，但冷氣直吹或空調溫度較低時，有時仍易涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 洪大 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 癆脈仍有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 症同前"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5月7日方，但大黃改為3錢，並加入蟬蛻及蛇蛻各5分（另包） "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 → 3 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 半夜3-5點會起來小便，是因體內在排濕，還有因為加入排腎結石藥，希望藉由小便多一點，大便軟，將血管或體內濕氣排出。半夜3-5點此時辰為肺經循行，而肺為腎之母，所以肺氣下降入腎，而腎臟功能不夠強壯，無法完全封藏，所以必須排掉以泄壓，故加入一些補腎藥強腎，例如巴戟天、何首烏及補骨脂。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 人超過50歲時陽會縮，體表血脈會相對浮起，患者年紀尚輕，不應有如此表現，因其血脈有濕氣累積，服用桂枝芍藥知母湯排濕一段時間，其血脈會縮小。就像藜蘆甘草湯症，痰在血脈神經中，病人會趺厥，身體會抖動，西醫查不出病因，也認為痰不是病。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 癆症最明顯的症狀就是怎麼吃都不會胖，而經方中只有桂枝芍藥知母湯用來治療癆症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}